const legacyPolicy='The score uses 60% investment and premises, 10% launch readiness, and 30% experience and suitability.\n\nInvestment contributes up to 22.5 points, ownership 15, area 22.5, launch time 10, experience 15, floor 10 and previous business 5.\n\nPercentiles award 3 points at the 90th percentile, 2 at the 50th, 1 at the 30th, otherwise 0. Higher investment, area and experience score better; fewer launch months score better. Owned earns 2 raw points, rented 1. Ground floor earns 2; confirmed first floor 1. Explicit prior business ownership/operation earns 1.\n\nCompare within city tier with at least five valid observations and variation; otherwise use the full upload. Equal values share a midrank, and edits between observed values use linear interpolation. References stay frozen until rebuilt. Unknown components produce a score range with a fixed denominator. These are prioritisation rules, not evidence that funds or premises have been verified.';
function policyText(settings={}){if(settings.model!=='industry-v2')return legacyPolicy;return `The active industry-informed v2 screening model is a proposed policy, not a published industry standard.\n\nWeights: declared financial adequacy 35%, premises readiness 30%, operator experience 25%, feasible launch 10%. Finance earns 35 × min(declared funds / ₹${settings.minInvestment} lakh, 1); area earns 15 × min(area / ${settings.minArea} sq ft, 1). Identified owned and rented sites each earn 15. Retail experience earns 0/5/10/15/20 points at 0/under 1/1–under 3/3–under 5/5+ years; explicit prior business operation earns 5. Launch ${settings.minLaunch}–${settings.targetLaunch} months earns 10, later 5, earlier 0 plus timeline review. These are illustrative brand assumptions and pilot anchors.\n\nGrade A is 80–100, B 65–below 80, C 50–below 65, D below 50, U when a scored input is unknown. Mandatory requirements and location gates override grades. Declared inputs are not verified funds or an approved site. The old 60/10/30 percentile score is kept only for comparison.`;}
